OL,3,AThirty-one killed in massive fire as
OL,4,Afuel tanker crashes on Cairo highway
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials have not given an account of
OL,7,Fhow the fire broke out, but state-owned
OL,8,Fmedia reported the tanker had
OL,9,Foverturned, dousing nearby vehicles
OL,10,Fwith petrol.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
