OL,3,AHas global jihadism failed, or is it
OL,4,Asimply changing shape?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"May God reward them," said a local
OL,7,Fwoman in one of al-Shabab's videos.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
